olors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/">Places to go</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/cities-towns/">Cities &amp; towns</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/cities-towns/nelson-city/">Nelson City</a></li></ol></nav><div class="ElementContent"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container pt-6 md:pt-12 lg:pt-16 pb-6 md:pb-12 lg:pb-20"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col prose lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl max-w-prose text-center"><h1 class="!mb-8">Discover the best of Nelson</h1><p>Nelson packs a surprising amount into a small, easy-going city. Great food and local flavours, a creative arts scene, stories that have shaped New Zealand, and some seriously good outdoor adventures all sit within easy reach. Explore what makes Nelson tick, then follow your interests to discover more.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalPageGrid"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="pt-6 md:pb-6 lg:pb-12"><div class="py-6 empty:hidden md:pt-12 container pb-12 lg:pb-16"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col prose lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl max-w-none text-start"><h2 class="!mb-8">Explo